      "widgets_values": [
        "# Drama 3 \u2014 MLX\n\nQueue now for plain TTS after runtime/model setup.\n\nFor voice cloning:\n1. Select/upload reference audio in Load Audio.\n2. Connect its AUDIO to reference_audio on Generate.\n3. Paste the words spoken in that recording into reference_text.\n4. Put the new words in text, then queue.\n\nUse CRTP Drama 3 \u00b7 Speaker Reference nodes chained through references for multiple voices; leave the single-reference inputs empty. Use <|speaker:0|>, <|speaker:1|>, etc. in target text.\n\nSetup: custom_nodes/comfy-random-toolpack/docs/drama3.md\nModel path is a directory under models/tts or an absolute directory.\nThe worker releases model memory after each run; loading adds latency.\nMLX: Apple Silicon; sampling seed supported.\n"
      ]
    }
